        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SHP70, 7 Inch Rectangular Cabinet Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 7 Inch Modern Rectangular Cup Pull is a great addition to any kitchen remodel. Its contemporary design adds a chicness that is accentuated through the huge selection of modern finishes in which this shell pull is available. The 7 Inch Rectangular Cabinet Cup Pull is easy to install an comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SHP70-specifications.gif?v=1704354670\" width=\"592\" height=\"151\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SHP70 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-modern-rectangular-cup-pull-deltana-shp40\"><b>Deltana SHP40 4 Inch Modern Rectangular Cup Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SHP70-installed.jpg?v=1704354671\" width=\"296\" height=\"221\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Deltana SHP70 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern 7 Inch Rectangular Cabinet Shell Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 7-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed either vertically or horizontally.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SHP70-specifications.pdf?v=1704262365\"><b>Deltana SHP70 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
