                "description": "The 7 Inch Modern Rectangular Cup Pull is a great addition to any kitchen remodel. Its contemporary design adds a chicness that is accentuated through the huge selection of modern finishes in which this shell pull is available. The 7 Inch Rectangular Cabinet Cup Pull is easy to install an comes packaged with the mounting hardware.",
